<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
	
	<!-- EN: aiming accuracy -->
	<AimingAccuracy.label>瞄准精度</AimingAccuracy.label>
	<!-- EN: How well a shooter can lead moving targets and estimate range in combination with the weapon's aiming efficiency.\n\nThe final modifier is calculated via this formula:\n(1.5 - aiming accuracy) / aiming efficiency\n\nLead error is calculated by multiplying this factor against total lead distance in cells. Range error is calculated by multiplying it against the total distance to the target divided by 4.\n\nAiming accuracy influences the the sway reduction during aimed shots. For example, at 75% aiming accuracy sway will be reduced to 25%. -->
	<AimingAccuracy.description>射手结合武器的瞄具效率，判断移动目标提前量和估算目标距离的能力。\n\n最终修正值根据以下公式计算：\n(1.5 - 瞄准精度) / 瞄具效率\n\n提前量误差通过该系数乘以总提前距离（格）计算。距离误差通过该系数乘以目标总距离再除以 4 计算。\n\n瞄准精度会影响瞄准射击时武器晃动的削减幅度。例如，瞄准精度为 75% 时，晃动会减少至 25%。</AimingAccuracy.description>
	
	<!-- EN: armor coverage -->
	<AverageSharpArmor.label>护甲覆盖度</AverageSharpArmor.label>
	<!-- EN: The average value of armor coverage across this person's body. Higher values will make them more confident against low-penetration projectiles. -->
	<AverageSharpArmor.description>此角色全身各部位护甲覆盖的平均值。数值越高，面对低穿透投射物时就越有信心。</AverageSharpArmor.description>
	<!-- EN: {0} mm RHA -->
	<AverageSharpArmor.formatString>{0} mm RHA</AverageSharpArmor.formatString>
	
	<!-- EN: body part MPa -->
	<BodyPartBluntArmor.label>身体部位护甲（钝器）</BodyPartBluntArmor.label>
	<!-- EN: Compared against weapon's armor penetration to see if it can penetrate to the next layer of body parts. A high value means low-penetration attacks like buckshot will have a harder time hitting internal organs. -->
	<BodyPartBluntArmor.description>与武器的护甲穿透力比较，用于判断攻击能否穿透至下一层身体部位。数值越高，鹿弹等低穿透攻击就越难击中内脏。</BodyPartBluntArmor.description>
	<!-- EN: {0} MPa -->
	<BodyPartBluntArmor.formatString>{0} MPa</BodyPartBluntArmor.formatString>
	
	<!-- EN: body part RHA -->
	<BodyPartSharpArmor.label>身体部位护甲（利器）</BodyPartSharpArmor.label>
	<!-- EN: Compared against weapon's armor penetration to see if it can penetrate to the next layer of body parts. A high value means low-penetration attacks like buckshot will have a harder time hitting internal organs. -->
	<BodyPartSharpArmor.description>与武器的护甲穿透力比较，用于判断攻击能否穿透至下一层身体部位。数值越高，鹿弹等低穿透攻击就越难击中内脏。</BodyPartSharpArmor.description>
	<!-- EN: {0} mm RHA -->
	<BodyPartSharpArmor.formatString>{0} mm RHA</BodyPartSharpArmor.formatString>
	
	<!-- EN: melee armor penetration -->
	<MeleeArmorPenetration.label>近战穿甲</MeleeArmorPenetration.label>
	<!-- EN: Armor penetration in melee. Determines how much damage is lost to enemy armor. -->
	<MeleeArmorPenetration.description>近战攻击的护甲穿透力，决定敌方护甲会抵消多少伤害。</MeleeArmorPenetration.description>
	
	<!-- EN: melee critical chance -->
	<MeleeCritChance.label>近战暴击率</MeleeCritChance.label>
	<!-- EN: Base chance to land a critical hit with a melee attack. Critical hits force max damage from the damage variation. On a critical hit, sharp attacks get double penetration, while blunt attacks stun the target.\nThe final chance depends on the opponent's critical skill and equal opponents will always have a 10% chance to crit. The internal formula is:\n\nFinalCritChance = ClampBetweenZeroAndOne(0.1 + AttackerCritChance - DefenderCritChance)*100% -->
	<MeleeCritChance.description>近战攻击造成暴击的基础概率。暴击会在伤害浮动范围内强制取最大伤害；利器攻击暴击时穿透力翻倍，钝器攻击暴击时会使目标眩晕。\n\n最终概率取决于对手的暴击能力，实力相当的对手始终有 10% 的暴击率。内部公式为：\n\n最终暴击率 = min(1, max(0, 0.1 + 攻击者暴击率 - 防御者暴击率)) * 100%</MeleeCritChance.description>
	
	<!-- EN: melee parry chance -->
	<MeleeParryChance.label>近战招架率</MeleeParryChance.label>
	<!-- EN: Base chance to parry a melee attack. When a parry is performed the equipped weapon or shield will take damage instead of the wielder. If the parrying pawn passes a critical chance check they will automatically riposte their attacker.\nThe final chance depends on the opponent's parry skill and equal opponents will always have a 20% chance to parry. The internal formula is:\n\nFinalParryChance = ClampBetweenZeroAndOne(0.2 + DefenderParryChance - AttackerParryChance * (1 + AttackerWeaponMeleeCounterParryBonus)*100%\n\nA pawn that is better skilled in parrying takes less damage from parrying while unarmed and is better at reducing damage taken by their weapon on parry. -->
	<MeleeParryChance.description>招架近战攻击的基础概率。成功招架时，装备的武器或盾牌会代替持用者承受伤害。若招架者通过一次暴击判定，还会自动反击攻击者。\n\n最终概率取决于对手的招架能力，实力相当的对手始终有 20% 的招架率。内部公式为：\n\n最终招架率 = min(1, max(0, 0.2 + 防御者招架率 - 攻击者招架率 * (1 + 攻击者武器反招架加成))) * 100%\n\n角色越擅长招架，徒手招架时受到的伤害就越低，也越能减少武器在招架时受到的伤害。</MeleeParryChance.description>
	
	<!-- EN: reload speed -->
	<ReloadSpeed.label>换弹速度</ReloadSpeed.label>
	<!-- EN: The speed at which firearms are reloaded. -->
	<ReloadSpeed.description>重新装填弹药的速度。</ReloadSpeed.description>
	
	<!-- EN: suppressability -->
	<Suppressability.label>压制敏感度</Suppressability.label>
	<!-- EN: How susceptible this person is to suppression. Loss of consciousness and certain drugs can lower this value, making it harder to suppress this person. -->
	<Suppressability.description>此角色受到压制影响的容易程度。失去意识和某些药物会降低该数值，使其更难被压制。</Suppressability.description>
	
	<!-- EN: unarmed damage bonus -->
	<UnarmedDamage.label>徒手伤害加成</UnarmedDamage.label>
	<!-- EN: Additional damage done in unarmed combat. -->
	<UnarmedDamage.description>徒手战斗时额外造成的伤害。</UnarmedDamage.description>
	
</LanguageData>
